1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,220
You mean you really don't remember our group, Sakura?

2
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:04,520
I don't.

3
00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:09,000
See, you're kind of a zombie.

4
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:11,120
Does this mean she can't be in the show?

5
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:13,460
But when the time comes, I know you'll be ready.

6
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:16,980
No, I can't do it.

7
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:20,700
It's like the world punishes me for even trying.

8
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:23,840
