9
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:28,240
If you want to do this idle thing, then go right ahead, but leave me out of it!

10
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:31,200
You don't know the first thing about me, because you've never died.

11
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:33,200
I have what it takes!

12
00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:34,820
Listen to me!

13
00:00:35,040 --> 00:00:38,940
I will never, and I mean never abandon you!

14
00:00:42,860 --> 00:00:44,080
Hey, good morning!

15
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:47,120
Good morning to you.

16
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:48,260
What's up, what's up, what's up?

17
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:52,840
Oh, Sakura, I thought for sure you'd still be hungover from your big pity party, but here you are.

18
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:54,740
Good morning, sad sack!

19
00:00:54,740 --> 00:00:58,120
Oh, jeez, watch those manners.

20
00:00:58,420 --> 00:01:00,420
No one's gonna respect you without them.

21
00:01:01,380 --> 00:01:03,640
I don't really care if people respect me or not.

22
00:01:03,640 --> 00:01:04,580
Yeah, well, I do.

23
00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:07,440
You can glare at me with those dead eyes all day long.

24
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:08,680
It won't change a thing.

25
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:10,900
You will be a part of this show.

26
00:01:10,900 --> 00:01:38,860
This feels kind of familiar.

27
00:01:38,860 --> 00:01:55,640
You will be a part of this show.

28
00:01:56,180 --> 00:01:58,140
There's no way I can do it.

29
00:01:58,140 --> 00:02:02,980
settings are terrible at all.

30
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:05,840
You'll be a part of this show.

31
00:02:06,020 --> 00:02:08,180
Ah.

32
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:09,800
You're kind of scary.

33
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:30,440
We start practice at the same time tomorrow, just so you know.

34
00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:33,180
And after that, we're going to go pass out flyers.

35
00:02:33,600 --> 00:02:34,960
We'd love for you to come.

36
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:51,460
Here's the info.

37
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:53,080
Hope you'll be there.

38
00:02:55,220 --> 00:02:57,300
What was I thinking coming here?

39
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:58,540
Number one.

40
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:00,640
Do you mind if I shake your hand?

41
00:03:01,460 --> 00:03:01,800
Oh.

42
00:03:02,220 --> 00:03:03,120
You're great.

43
00:03:03,720 --> 00:03:06,100
Watching you sing and dance always makes me happy.

44
00:03:06,460 --> 00:03:08,120
You inspire me so much.

45
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:09,640
I can hardly wait for Arpino.

46
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:11,300
We'll be cheering you on.

47
00:03:12,020 --> 00:03:13,140
Wow, thanks, you two.

48
00:03:13,440 --> 00:03:14,560
You're the best.

49
00:03:14,700 --> 00:03:15,800
And I've seen your faces.

50
00:03:16,100 --> 00:03:18,840
If you don't show, I'm going to come and hunt you down.

51
00:03:19,040 --> 00:03:19,640
Number two.

52
00:03:19,980 --> 00:03:20,720
We'll be there.

53
00:03:21,140 --> 00:03:22,120
Do your best.

54
00:03:22,380 --> 00:03:22,640
Right.

55
00:03:23,100 --> 00:03:23,980
See you then.

56
00:03:26,480 --> 00:03:27,520
Look at that.

57
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:30,200
You're pretty popular, aren't you?

58
00:03:30,200 --> 00:03:30,300
Yeah.

59
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:41,280
Watching you sing and dance always makes me happy.

60
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:44,780
I wonder what my singing and dancing were like.

61
00:03:49,940 --> 00:03:52,020
It's always the same story, though.

62
00:03:52,980 --> 00:03:54,120
I get my hopes up.

63
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:57,460
Then I ruin everything and regret trying it all.

64
00:03:57,460 --> 00:04:11,580
If I do this, I'll just bring them down with me.

65
00:04:11,860 --> 00:04:12,300
Listen!

66
00:04:12,940 --> 00:04:15,240
I swear I will never abandon you!

67
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:16,740
No, forget that.

68
00:04:17,220 --> 00:04:18,800
There's no hope it'll work out.

69
00:04:19,140 --> 00:04:20,780
I know that better than anyone else.

70
00:04:20,780 --> 00:04:27,760
Leave me alone!

71
00:04:27,820 --> 00:04:28,520
I don't care!

72
00:04:41,780 --> 00:04:43,860
