76
00:04:48,520 --> 00:04:51,480
Are we really going to have to go on stage without Sakura there?

77
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:53,960
Uh-huh.

78
00:04:53,960 --> 00:04:54,360
Uh-huh.

79
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:07,100
