80
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:11,340
I reinforced the door when I fixed it, so I don't think she can.

81
00:05:14,080 --> 00:05:15,440
Oh, she's crying.

82
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:16,340
You're kidding!

83
00:05:18,520 --> 00:05:21,020
Wait, I think that's drool.

84
00:05:21,220 --> 00:05:21,800
Oh, man.

85
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:23,220
That can't be good.

86
