87
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:31,280
What is she doing?

88
00:05:31,280 --> 00:05:45,180
It's me.

89
00:05:45,180 --> 00:06:07,140
What's with you?

90
00:06:07,140 --> 00:06:08,140
I think I understand.

91
00:06:08,140 --> 00:06:35,700
Yeah, Sakura was never the type to half-ass it, was she?

92
00:06:35,700 --> 00:06:37,940
Right, and she refused to give up.

93
00:06:38,260 --> 00:06:42,260
When she helped her learn the routine, I bet it made Tai happy.

94
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:43,940
So that's why...

95
00:06:43,940 --> 00:06:46,100
She's trying to teach Sakura this time.

96
00:06:46,480 --> 00:06:50,200
When someone had a problem or kept messing up, she was the first one to jump in.

97
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:52,060
In her own awkward manner.

98
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:56,560
Thanks to all her encouragement, I conquered my fears of working in a group.

99
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:59,220
She was always willing to listen to my ideas.

100
00:06:59,300 --> 00:07:02,400
So let's think of this as a chance to pay Sakura back.

101
00:07:02,740 --> 00:07:03,240
I agree.

102
00:07:03,440 --> 00:07:05,240
She needs her friends now more than ever.

103
00:07:05,580 --> 00:07:06,780
We shouldn't let her down.

104
00:07:07,060 --> 00:07:09,920
If we all try hard, I'm sure we'll think of something.

105
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:11,240
Yeah, sounds good.

106
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:14,000
This is what Team Franchu-shu is all about, right?

107
00:07:14,220 --> 00:07:16,500
We've got each other's backs no matter what.

108
00:07:17,060 --> 00:07:19,740
Okay, time for us to get your head on str...

109
00:07:19,740 --> 00:07:24,860
I'm telling you, there's no point.

110
00:07:25,320 --> 00:07:29,020
You guys are getting yourselves all excited over a bunch of stuff that I don't even remember

111
00:07:29,020 --> 00:07:30,600
happening in the first place.

112
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:33,180
Well, good night.

113
00:07:33,180 --> 00:07:44,020
That's enough.

114
00:07:44,340 --> 00:07:46,340
I cannot let you run away any longer.

115
00:07:47,340 --> 00:07:50,260
You've encouraged us till now, and you must see this through.

116
00:07:50,640 --> 00:07:54,980
Whether you can remember anything or not, you're still going to join us on that stage.

117
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:56,200
Of all the selfish-

118
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:57,740
I'm fully aware that it's selfish.

119
00:07:57,740 --> 00:08:05,540
I don't get why all of you care so much about me.

120
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:09,600
What difference does it make if I perform with you?

121
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:10,920
Just look at their faces.

122
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:18,740
We understand that you no longer have any memories, and that your luck may be bad.

123
00:08:19,300 --> 00:08:23,440
But these are troubled times, Lady Sakura, and we need you.

124
00:08:23,440 --> 00:08:29,980
Our sisterhood may be strong now, but without you holding us together, we would never have

125
00:08:29,980 --> 00:08:30,720
gotten this far.

126
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:33,980
Lady Time made me see.

127
00:08:34,820 --> 00:08:40,180
If the only way for the show to be a success is without you, then I would much rather the

128
00:08:40,180 --> 00:08:41,620
seven of us fail together.

129
00:08:42,980 --> 00:08:45,560
Please, try to understand that.

130
00:08:45,560 --> 00:08:51,160
Sakura, you seem to think that you're the only one here with bad luck.

131
