135
00:09:02,420 --> 00:09:05,400
I don't think of mistakes or failures as bad things.

136
00:09:05,780 --> 00:09:07,200
That's not how it works.

137
00:09:08,300 --> 00:09:11,060
They always end up helping me with whatever happens next.

138
00:09:11,060 --> 00:09:16,320
If I want to be the best version of me, then I'll have to find a way over the hurdles.

139
00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:21,040
Think about it, guys.

140
00:09:21,240 --> 00:09:24,100
