146
00:09:56,820 --> 00:09:58,320
You've really got it down now!

147
00:09:58,460 --> 00:10:00,100
I guess it's your muscle memory.

148
00:10:00,100 --> 00:10:02,940
She did practice the most out of the whole group.

149
00:10:07,940 --> 00:10:13,320
I knew it.

150
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:14,540
Sakura!

151
00:10:18,740 --> 00:10:19,300
Huh?

152
00:10:20,580 --> 00:10:20,960
Huh.

153
00:10:21,220 --> 00:10:22,660
Now who's got bad luck?

154
00:10:25,280 --> 00:10:26,580
That's how luck is.

155
00:10:26,580 --> 00:10:31,620
It can change whenever people, or when zombies, work together.

156
00:10:31,940 --> 00:10:33,560
But, you sure about this?

157
00:10:33,740 --> 00:10:35,820
You all put so much into your show.

158
00:10:36,040 --> 00:10:37,240
Yeah, so did you!

159
00:10:37,500 --> 00:10:40,360
You were right there with us every step of the way!

160
00:10:40,500 --> 00:10:41,620
We're in this for life.

161
00:10:42,260 --> 00:10:43,100
Or afterlife.

162
00:10:46,640 --> 00:10:47,080
Sakura.

163
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:49,460
We're going to do our best.

164
00:10:49,460 --> 00:10:51,120
