181
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:29,960
Oh yeah, that was the last concert we put on.

182
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:32,600
I hope these Frans Shushu kids are good.

183
00:12:32,980 --> 00:12:33,700
So do I.

184
00:12:37,020 --> 00:12:38,360
We've put in the time.

185
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:41,100
All we can do now is give it our best shot.

186
00:12:42,060 --> 00:12:43,900
So let's just focus on that.

187
00:12:44,380 --> 00:12:45,940
We did great in practice.

188
00:12:47,380 --> 00:12:48,480
Yeah, I guess so.

189
