Snow is falling down, down.

190
00:12:51,720 --> 00:12:53,980
Hail is falling down, down.

191
00:12:54,760 --> 00:12:57,200
Well, duh, where else is it gonna fall?

192
00:12:57,980 --> 00:12:59,540
It's chilly, but it's okay.

193
00:12:59,900 --> 00:13:01,060
Just gotta be tough.

194
00:13:01,420 --> 00:13:02,960
I wouldn't miss this for the world.

195
00:13:03,100 --> 00:13:04,160
