197
00:13:06,860 --> 00:13:06,900
Holy cow.

198
00:13:07,380 --> 00:13:08,500
This is some turnout.

199
00:13:08,500 --> 00:13:13,260
All your fans are waiting.

200
00:13:13,940 --> 00:13:15,440
I believe in you.

201
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:18,480
Circle up, guys.

202
00:13:21,480 --> 00:13:22,580
We'll be okay.

203
00:13:22,900 --> 00:13:24,520
We've had tons of rehearsal time.

204
00:13:24,760 --> 00:13:26,060
And we've got our team.

205
00:13:26,420 --> 00:13:27,260
Let's have faith.

206
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:29,160
Awesome!

207
00:13:29,300 --> 00:13:30,800
Time to go take over Saga!

208
00:13:31,340 --> 00:13:31,780
Right!

209
00:13:31,780 --> 00:13:32,080
Right!

210
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:32,380
Right!

211
00:13:32,380 --> 00:13:32,740
Right!

212
00:13:32,740 --> 00:13:32,920
Right!

213
00:13:32,920 --> 00:13:32,960
Right!

214
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:33,040
Right!

215
00:13:38,500 --> 00:13:50,180
Oh, no.

216
00:13:50,700 --> 00:13:53,920
