Running away with BB.

222
00:14:24,860 --> 00:14:25,720
Now I'm stuck.

223
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:29,000
Don't stop.

224
00:14:29,180 --> 00:14:30,060
Gotta push through.

225
00:14:30,240 --> 00:14:32,060
Don't forget what's inside you.

226
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:33,580
Put on a smile, it's okay.

227
00:14:33,980 --> 00:14:36,420
Life goes on, though we decay.

228
00:14:36,420 --> 00:14:41,720
Stop the show right now!

229
00:14:41,780 --> 00:14:42,160
We're on it!

230
00:14:42,240 --> 00:14:42,600
Wait.

231
00:14:43,660 --> 00:14:48,340
