I have what it takes!

259
00:16:58,640 --> 00:17:02,400
Whether or not you have what it takes is irrelevant, because I do!

260
00:17:08,100 --> 00:17:10,480
Answer their call, Sakura.

261
00:17:12,360 --> 00:17:14,040
When you're up against a wall,

262
00:17:14,440 --> 00:17:17,540
that's when your true strength shines.

263
00:17:18,140 --> 00:17:19,000
You'll see.

264
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:28,460
You can rise again!

265
00:17:34,460 --> 00:17:35,480
Hey, change of plans.

266
00:17:35,740 --> 00:17:36,640
Are we back up yet?

267
00:17:36,760 --> 00:17:37,380
Good to go!

268
00:17:37,380 --> 00:17:44,760
No more hiding, let the lighten tear down every wall.

269
00:17:45,220 --> 00:17:50,020
